# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose. An unanchored "native/" also
# matches api/native/, which silently dropped the native IAP endpoint from
# every deployment - /api/native/record-purchase 404ed while the app kept
# POSTing to it. Keep directory patterns root-anchored; tests/e2e.mjs checks
# that nothing under api/ is excluded.
/native/*
# The iCloud plugin is a package.json dependency (file:native/icloud-backup),
# and Vercel runs npm install, so it has to ship or every deployment fails.
!/native/icloud-backup
resources/
scripts/*
!scripts/fetch-tesseract.mjs
!scripts/patch-google-auth.mjs
!scripts/patch-android-plugins-agp9.mjs
prompts/
landing/
pnpm-lock.yaml
capacitor.config.json
/.claude/
/.impeccable/
/PRODUCT.md
